[{"text": "The assembly will hear an address by his", "start": 3.76, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "excellency Samuel and Sukane Matakane,", "start": 5.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Prime Minister and Minister of Defense", "start": 9.76, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "and National Security of the Kingdom of", "start": 11.44, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "Lutu.", "start": 13.84, "duration": 3.279}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort his", "start": 15.36, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "excellency and invite him to address the", "start": 17.119, "duration": 5.481}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 19.6, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 41.84, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "excellencies,", "start": 44.48, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "at the outset,", "start": 46.719, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "allow me to extend my warm and heartfelt", "start": 48.719, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "congratulations to you", "start": 51.2, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "on your election as president of the", "start": 54.079, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "81st session of the General Assembly.", "start": 56.64, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "Your election reflects the confidence of", "start": 60.96, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "member states in your steadfast", "start": 64.559, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "commitment to multilateral system.", "start": 67.439, "duration": 7.761}, {"text": "and we have vision for a United Nations", "start": 72.24, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "that is responsive,", "start": 75.2, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "effective, and capable of delivering for", "start": 77.6, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "humanity.", "start": 80.72, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "As we embark on this important journey,", "start": 82.72, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "my delegation", "start": 85.84, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "reaffirms its unwavering commitment to", "start": 88.08, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "working closely with you and all member", "start": 91.52, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "states to ensure a productive and", "start": 94.479, "duration": 6.761}, {"text": "successful session.", "start": 97.119, "duration": 4.121}, {"text": "I also pay tribute to your predecessor,", "start": 102.079, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "her excellency,", "start": 105.68, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Miss Babok, president of the 80th", "start": 108.0, "duration": 7.119}, {"text": "session of the general assembly,", "start": 111.2, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "with whom my delegation had the honor to", "start": 115.119, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "serve as vice president. Her dedicated", "start": 118.56, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "leadership,", "start": 121.759, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "skill and tenacity of purpose in", "start": 123.28, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "strengthening multilateral cooperation", "start": 126.88, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "during a period of profound global", "start": 129.44, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "uncertainty gave us hope that the future", "start": 131.84, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "of this organization", "start": 135.92, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "can be secured when all nations work", "start": 137.84, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "together for the common goal of leaving", "start": 140.959, "duration": 6.601}, {"text": "no one behind.", "start": 144.08, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "To the Secretary General, Mr. Antonio", "start": 147.599, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Gudares", "start": 150.08, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "whose tenor is approaching an end. My", "start": 151.599, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "delegation commends his ex exemplary", "start": 154.959, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "leadership and commitment to the ideals", "start": 157.92, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "of the United Nations. During his term,", "start": 161.519, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "the world confronted unprecedented", "start": 165.04, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "challenges", "start": 167.92, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "from the coid9 pandemic to the eruption", "start": 169.519, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "of new conflicts, the catastrophic", "start": 172.959, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "effects of climate change and unstable", "start": 176.239, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "uh trade regimes.", "start": 179.92, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Throughout this crisis, he remained the", "start": 182.239, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "moral force and steady anchor of the", "start": 185.92, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "organization.", "start": 188.4, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "We salute him for his distinguished", "start": 191.04, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "service and will fondly cherish his", "start": 194.319, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "historic visit to the mountain kingdom", "start": 197.92, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "in December 2024", "start": 201.28, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "during which he witnessed firsthand of", "start": 204.48, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "the dividends", "start": 208.4, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "of the UN's contribution to lutu.", "start": 210.4, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 214.959, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "the theme for this session,", "start": 216.959, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "restoring trust, managing", "start": 219.44, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "transformation,", "start": 221.92, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "a a United Nations that delivers for all", "start": 223.44, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "resonate deeply with Lutu's aspirations", "start": 228.48, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "for a more inclusive, transparent, and", "start": 231.84, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "resultoriented", "start": 235.36, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "multilateral system capable of advancing", "start": 237.439, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "respect for international law,", "start": 240.959, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "maintaining global peace and security,", "start": 244.08, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "accelerating sustainable development,", "start": 247.28, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "protecting human rights, driving climate", "start": 250.4, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "action, and implementing long overdue", "start": 253.04, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "institutional reforms.", "start": 256.079, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "Leoto has restored national peace and", "start": 259.12, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "security following successive episodes", "start": 262.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "of political and security unrest", "start": 265.199, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "with the support of the United Nations,", "start": 268.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "the African Union, Saddak and other", "start": 270.96, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "friendly nations. We have reclaimed our", "start": 274.24, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "rightful place among the community of", "start": 278.08, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "nations as a stable and peaceful", "start": 281.68, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "country.", "start": 284.24, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "We therefore attest that preventative", "start": 286.08, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "diplomacy remains the most effective", "start": 289.68, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "means of aing conflict and ensuring", "start": 293.04, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "sustainable peace", "start": 296.4, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "to create an environment conducive to", "start": 300.16, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "inclusive growth and development. We", "start": 303.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "continue to advance constitutional", "start": 306.639, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "reforms aimed at strengthening", "start": 308.72, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "democratic governance and the rule of", "start": 311.039, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "law.", "start": 313.44, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "We remain committed", "start": 314.88, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "to accountability,", "start": 317.199, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "professionalism, and respect for human", "start": 319.36, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "rights for all sectors of society. We", "start": 321.68, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "recognize that culture of peace requires", "start": 326.08, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "strong institutions that negate violence", "start": 329.28, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "in all its forms.", "start": 333.12, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "an independent judiciary capable of", "start": 336.0, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "delivering justice impartially and", "start": 338.4, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "efficiently to restore public trust.", "start": 341.12, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 346.08, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "we must acknowledge that climate change", "start": 348.24, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "is no longer a future threat but a", "start": 350.88, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "present reality.", "start": 353.84, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Loto is increasingly experiencing severe", "start": 355.84, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "floods and droughts resulting in", "start": 358.72, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "unparalleled", "start": 362.72, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "land degradation and extensive damage to", "start": 364.24, "duration": 7.079}, {"text": "critical infrastructure.", "start": 367.759, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "Despite contributing minimally to global", "start": 371.84, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "greenhouse gas emissions, least", "start": 374.639, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "developed countries like Loto bear a", "start": 377.44, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "heavy brand of climate impact.", "start": 380.24, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "Global warming and rising sea levels", "start": 384.24, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "pose terrible threats particularly to", "start": 387.199, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "small islands", "start": 390.0, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "developing states.", "start": 393.199, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "We stand in solidarity with these", "start": 395.28, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "nations and call for greater global", "start": 397.6, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "action", "start": 400.0, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "to cope with these climate related", "start": 402.72, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "challenges. We call upon developed", "start": 404.639, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "countries to honor their commitments by", "start": 407.44, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "providing new adequate, predictable and", "start": 410.96, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "accessible climate finance.", "start": 414.16, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "Further, we urge developed countries to", "start": 416.96, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "transfer environmentally sound", "start": 419.759, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "technology and to strengthen capacity of", "start": 421.759, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "developing countries to effectively", "start": 424.72, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "mitigate and adapt to the adverse", "start": 427.36, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "effects of climate change.", "start": 430.4, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "Climate justice demands nothing less.", "start": 434.24, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "Just energy transition is therefore an", "start": 437.919, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "imperative if humanity is to be spared", "start": 440.319, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "from the terrible threat of climate", "start": 444.319, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "change. Under the visionary leadership", "start": 446.72, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "of his majesty King Lithia thei, Leo has", "start": 449.44, "duration": 8.159}, {"text": "launched the his majesty king Lithia the", "start": 453.52, "duration": 8.239}, {"text": "third just energy transition fund", "start": 457.599, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "designed not only to decarbonize our", "start": 461.759, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "economy but to transform it from one", "start": 465.039, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "historically reliant on migrant labor to", "start": 468.4, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "one rooted in renewable energy exports.", "start": 472.08, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "The fund seeks to attract investment to", "start": 475.759, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "build new energy generation capacity,", "start": 478.879, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "unlock energy independence and lay a new", "start": 482.0, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "foundation for national prosperity that", "start": 485.36, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "benefits every Mosu.", "start": 488.879, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "We therefore we therefore call for", "start": 491.919, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "partnerships to mobilize the requisite", "start": 494.319, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "resources for clean energy project which", "start": 497.84, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "can create significant employment", "start": 501.84, "duration": 7.32}, {"text": "opportunities for our youth and women", "start": 503.84, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "as the first member of state to pilot", "start": 509.599, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "the UN blueprint for national AI and", "start": 512.56, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "data strategies from design into", "start": 517.279, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "national implementation. ation. Loto", "start": 520.0, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "stands ready to share the lessons of", "start": 522.399, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "that journey with fellow developing", "start": 525.36, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "countries", "start": 528.16, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "particularly across Africa and among", "start": 529.68, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "least developed and landlocked", "start": 532.16, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "developing countries.", "start": 534.72, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Chatting similar paths towards digital", "start": 537.279, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "sovereignity.", "start": 539.68, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Central to that experience has been the", "start": 541.279, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "value of the United Nations system", "start": 544.0, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "acting as one coordinated around", "start": 546.64, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "priorities that we ourselves defined", "start": 550.16, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "rather than delivered through separate", "start": 554.56, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "and uncoordinated channels.", "start": 556.72, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "This is what the United Nations", "start": 559.519, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "that delivers for all looks like in", "start": 563.12, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "practice and we commend this model to", "start": 565.68, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "the organization as it advances the UN8", "start": 569.12, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "initiative. We further stand ready to", "start": 573.2, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "contribute our experience to emerging", "start": 576.32, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "instruments such as the proposed global", "start": 579.04, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "fund for AI capacity building", "start": 582.16, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "so that the compromise of artificial", "start": 586.56, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "intelligence may be governed responsibly", "start": 589.12, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "and shared equitably among all nations.", "start": 592.24, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "We are grateful for the UN's continued", "start": 596.32, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "support in this digital transformation", "start": 598.8, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "journey.", "start": 601.839, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 603.68, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "the Kingdom of Loto remains committed to", "start": 605.76, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "the 2030 agenda.", "start": 608.24, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "We have accelerated reforms in business", "start": 610.8, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "development,", "start": 613.36, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "trade facilitation,", "start": 615.12, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "public financial management, youth", "start": 617.2, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "empowerment, and renewable energy. Yet,", "start": 619.839, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "challenges persist.", "start": 623.68, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Economic diversification remains", "start": 625.839, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "limited.", "start": 628.0, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Youth unemployment stands at 38%.", "start": 629.6, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "And climate related shocks and equality", "start": 633.44, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "continue to constrain inclusive", "start": 636.56, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "transformation.", "start": 639.279, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "With only three years remaining until", "start": 641.04, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "2030, we appeal to the international", "start": 643.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "community to honor their official", "start": 647.04, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "development assistance commitments which", "start": 649.36, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "is which is an essential step in", "start": 652.959, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "restoring trust.", "start": 656.48, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "We further call for reform of the", "start": 659.839, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "international financial architecture to", "start": 662.32, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "make it more equitable, fit for purpose", "start": 665.12, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and responsive to the needs of", "start": 669.04, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "developing countries. ESRE at the fourth", "start": 671.12, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "summit for financing for development", "start": 674.72, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "FFD4", "start": 678.8, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "held in sevil Spain last year.", "start": 680.399, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "We also urge full implementation of the", "start": 684.56, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "outcomes of the third summit of", "start": 687.04, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "landlocked develop developing countries", "start": 690.16, "duration": 10.32}, {"text": "held in Awasa Tministan in August 2025.", "start": 694.24, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "The implementation of these outcomes", "start": 700.48, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "without further delay together with the", "start": 703.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "pact of the future will undoubtedly help", "start": 705.839, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "restore eroded trust.", "start": 708.88, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "Mr. President, universal health coverage", "start": 711.92, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "remains central to our development", "start": 715.279, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "agenda. While investment have been made,", "start": 717.2, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "we continue to face serious public", "start": 721.519, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "health challenges including a high", "start": 723.519, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "burden of communicable and non-communic", "start": 726.639, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "non-committable disease and equalities", "start": 730.16, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "in access to health. Lutu is undertaking", "start": 733.76, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "reforms to strengthen our health care", "start": 738.0, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "system and invite partnerships to ensure", "start": 740.24, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "universal access to quality", "start": 744.399, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "primary health medicines, vaccines,", "start": 747.6, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "diagnostics, and robust disease", "start": 751.2, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "surveillance and pandemic preparedness.", "start": 753.279, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "The social and economic cost of cancer", "start": 758.0, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "are profound.", "start": 760.56, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "With support from the international", "start": 762.56, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "atomic energy agency, Lysoto is", "start": 764.32, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "developing its first", "start": 767.519, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "radiotherapy and nuclear medicine", "start": 770.24, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "facility to provide domestic oncology", "start": 772.88, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "services. We therefore call for enhanced", "start": 776.639, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "cooperation in technology sharing,", "start": 780.48, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "capacity building, and sustainable", "start": 783.519, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "health financing to build resilient", "start": 785.839, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "health systems capable of responding to", "start": 788.399, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "current and emerging challenges.", "start": 791.44, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 794.399, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "migration is not an abstract concept for", "start": 796.399, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "the people of Lutu. It is a daily lift", "start": 799.68, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "reality. It is woven into our social", "start": 803.36, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "fabric as human ambition rooted dignity,", "start": 806.959, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "opportunity and aspiration.", "start": 812.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Migration benefits countries of origin,", "start": 814.88, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "transit countries and destination", "start": 818.24, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "countries contributing to skills", "start": 820.24, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "development,", "start": 822.639, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "cultural exchange and shared economic", "start": 824.16, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "growth. We must therefore strengthen", "start": 826.48, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "international cooperation to ensure", "start": 828.959, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "migration contributes meaningfully to", "start": 831.44, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "deeper human understanding and", "start": 834.16, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "sustainable development.", "start": 836.8, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Guided by the universal declaration of", "start": 838.959, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "human rights, we must guarantee the full", "start": 841.04, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "enjoyment", "start": 843.839, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "of human rights by migrants regardless", "start": 845.839, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "of status. Protecting their dignity and", "start": 849.279, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "fundamental freedoms is not only a legal", "start": 852.639, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "obligation, it is a moral imperative.", "start": 855.519, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 859.6, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "we welcome progress under the UN8", "start": 861.519, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "initiative and appreciate efforts to", "start": 864.16, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "enhance efficiency,", "start": 867.04, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "effectiveness,", "start": 869.04, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "and coherence", "start": 870.88, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "within the UN system.", "start": 872.72, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "As the liberations continue,", "start": 875.519, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "reforms must remain guided by", "start": 878.32, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "intergovernmental agreed mandates and", "start": 880.88, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "member states priorities.", "start": 883.76, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Any missions undertaken should preserve", "start": 886.079, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "the UN's capacity to deliver across all", "start": 889.04, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "pillars of its work and maintain", "start": 891.6, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "meaningful impact on the ground. Mr.", "start": 894.56, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "President, as we contemplate the future", "start": 898.959, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "of Community of Nations, we must renew", "start": 902.48, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "our collective commitment to a United", "start": 906.0, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "Nations that is more inclusive,", "start": 909.12, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "effective,", "start": 912.079, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "and responsive to modern times global", "start": 913.6, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "challenges and one in which developing", "start": 916.24, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "countries, particularly African nations,", "start": 919.839, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "have a stronger voice in global decision", "start": 922.639, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "making. We reiterate our support for", "start": 924.72, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "comprehensive reform of the security", "start": 928.56, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "council", "start": 931.36, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "in line with the Sulini consul to make", "start": 932.88, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "it more representative,", "start": 936.639, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "equitable and reflective of our current", "start": 939.68, "duration": 7.719}, {"text": "geopolitical realities.", "start": 943.12, "duration": 4.279}, {"text": "The Kingdom of Loto reaffirms its", "start": 948.24, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "unwavering commitment to the charter of", "start": 950.959, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "the United Nations.", "start": 953.759, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "Multilateral system and the rule of law,", "start": 955.92, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "international law remains the", "start": 959.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "cornerstone of sovereign equality.", "start": 961.839, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "Peace coexist existence and sustainable", "start": 965.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "development.", "start": 968.48, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Mr. President, the rise in regional", "start": 970.72, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "conflicts is cause for deep concern. We", "start": 973.12, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "call for effective diplomatic solutions", "start": 977.04, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "to secure lasting peace in Ukraine, the", "start": 980.24, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "Middle East, Sudan, and Eastern DRC. We", "start": 983.759, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "welcome the ceasefire framework and", "start": 987.92, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "stabilization arrangement in Gaza and", "start": 990.399, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "call for sustained engagement to achieve", "start": 993.279, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "a lasting solution based on the 1967", "start": 996.32, "duration": 7.759}, {"text": "borders where Israelis and Palestinians", "start": 1000.32, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "coexist in peace and harmony.", "start": 1004.079, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Regarding the broader conflict in the", "start": 1008.16, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Gulf, we urge all parties to intensify", "start": 1010.399, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "efforts towards a speedy resolution as", "start": 1013.6, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "its economic impact is dire and", "start": 1017.44, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "devastating for humanity cannot continue", "start": 1020.399, "duration": 8.52}, {"text": "to bear the high cost of these wars.", "start": 1024.319, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "We should draw inspiration from the", "start": 1029.039, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "wisdom of Chief Muslim,", "start": 1030.959, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "one of our renowned diplomats who", "start": 1033.6, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "advised Morana Musha the first, the", "start": 1036.88, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "founding father of the Vasuti nation.", "start": 1040.72, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "That it is better to thrash corn than", "start": 1043.839, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "sharpen the spear.", "start": 1047.679, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "As the United Nation, we must continue", "start": 1050.08, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "investing in conflict prevention and", "start": 1052.96, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "building strong democract democratic", "start": 1055.679, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "institutions grounded in good", "start": 1059.12, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "governance, peace, and respect for", "start": 1061.039, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "international law.", "start": 1063.36, "duration": 3.559}, {"text": "Mr. President, my delegation continues", "start": 1067.2, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "to call for the lifting of longstanding", "start": 1070.4, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "sanctions on Cuba and Zimbabwe. These", "start": 1073.52, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "measures deprive innocent civilians of", "start": 1076.799, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "their right to development.", "start": 1079.76, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "In conclusion, Loto firmly believes that", "start": 1083.36, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "cooperation, solidarity, and shared", "start": 1086.88, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "responsibility are the only viable path", "start": 1090.16, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "towards a peaceful, prosperous, and", "start": 1093.36, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "sustainable future. Let us recommmit", "start": 1096.24, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "ourselves to a multilateral system that", "start": 1099.12, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "delivers tangible results for humanity,", "start": 1102.88, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "protects our planet, promote peace and", "start": 1106.72, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "international security and ensures that", "start": 1109.679, "duration": 8.761}, {"text": "no one is left behind. I thank you.", "start": 1112.72, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly, I wish to", "start": 1124.16, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "thank the Prime Minister and Minister of", "start": 1125.76, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "Defense and National Security of the", "start": 1127.6, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "Kingdom of Lutu.", "start": 1129.919, "duration": 3.561}]